  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "06eabb3a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### Final conclusion\n",
    "Logistic Regression is the selected model because it achieved the strongest mean 5-fold CV F1 among the evaluated candidates. The final test F1 is 0.6796 at the development-selected threshold of 0.66. The model is packaged as a reusable Joblib pipeline with preprocessing and threshold metadata."
   ]
